WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:04.246
A block of iron that once
lay in the schooner’s belly

00:00:04.246 --> 00:00:06.343
became the anvil for another vessel.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.119
Raynal could make chisels and a saw.

00:00:13.119 --> 00:00:14.894
Out in the yard lay the heavy timbers

00:00:14.894 --> 00:00:16.781
he still had to bore for bolts.

